Apple this week unveiled the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/09/apple-announces-iphone-18-pro-and-iphone-18-pro-max/">iPhone 18 Pro and iPhone 18 Pro Max</a>. While the devices look very similar to the iPhone 17 Pro models, there are still quite a few new features and incremental changes compared to the previous generation.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/09/iPhone-18-Pro-Burgundy-Feature.jpeg" alt="" width="1600" height="900" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1063870" /><br/>
<br/>
Below, we have recapped 10 new features coming with the iPhone 18 Pro models, which can be pre-ordered starting Saturday, September 12 at 5 a.m. Pacific Time and will begin arriving to customers and launch in stores Friday, September 18.<br/>
<br/>
<ul><li><strong>A20 Pro chip</strong>, the first 2nm chip in an iPhone. It has a 6-core CPU, a 7-core GPU, and a 32-core Neural Engine. Apple says the chip delivers <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/10/iphone-18-pro-max-benchmarks-reveal-a20-pro-speed/">up to 20% faster CPU performance</a> and up to 40% faster graphics performance compared to the A19 Pro chip in the iPhone 17 Pro. Apple also says sustained performance is up to 40% faster.</li><br/>
<br/>
<li><strong>Three new color options</strong>: <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/09/apple-reveals-iphone-18-pro-four-new-colors/">Burgundy, Black, and Glacier</a>. Orange is no longer an option. The rear aluminum and Ceramic Shield glass area are now more color matched.</li><br/>
<br/>
<li>A <strong>smaller Dynamic Island</strong> with <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/09/iphone-18-pro-features-smaller-dynamic-island/">support for up to three Live Activities at once</a>.</li><br/>
<br/>
<li>The main 48-megapixel Fusion camera on both the iPhone 18 Pro and iPhone 18 Pro Max <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/09/iphone-18-pro-gains-manual-aperture-and-more/">has <strong>variable aperture</strong></a>, allowing you to adjust the amount of light that reaches the image sensor for greater control over depth of field. Apple says this upgrade will allow for improved low-light photography and crisper details in the back of group photos. Aperture options include ƒ/1.48, ƒ/1.8, ƒ/2.8, and ƒ/4.0.</li><br/>
<br/>
<li>In the Camera app on iPhone 18 Pro models, new <strong>Pro controls</strong> allow you to manually control or adjust shutter speed, white balance, and aperture, and there is an option to use a histogram.</li><br/>
<br/>
<li>iPhone 18 Pro models can record <strong>time-lapse videos in 4K and Dolby Vision HDR</strong>.</li><br/>
<br/>
<li>Both of the iPhone 18 Pro models have <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/09/iphone-18-pro-max-battery/"><strong>longer battery life</strong></a> compared to the previous generation — especially the iPhone 18 Pro Max. If we go by Apple's offline video playback metric, the iPhone 18 Pro Max has up to 15% longer battery life compared to the iPhone 17 Pro Max. Fast charging to 50% now takes 15 minutes, down from 20 minutes.</li><br/>
<br/>
<li>The <strong>revamped vapor chamber cooling system</strong> in the iPhone 18 Pro models has <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/09/iphone-18-pro-redesigned-vapor-chamber/">three times more surface area</a> than the one in the iPhone 17 Pro models, for even better heat dissipation.</li><br/>
<br/>
<li>At least some iPhone 18 Pro models in some countries have Apple's second-generation <strong>C2 cellular modem</strong> for 5G and LTE. Apple says the C2 chip has "AI-powered improvements" to cellular quality and reliability, delivering "meaningfully faster uploads when compared to its previous C1X modem while consuming 15% less energy. In the U.S., the chip supports mmWave 5G.</li><br/>
<br/>
<li>There is now a <strong>2TB storage capacity for both the Pro and Pro Max</strong> models — it was previously exclusive to the iPhone 17 Pro Max.</li></ul><div class="linkback">Related Roundup: <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-18-pro/">iPhone 18 Pro</a></div><div class="linkback">Related Forum: <a href="https://forums.macrumors.com/forums/iphone.99">iPhone</a></div><br/>This article, &quot;<a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/10/iphone-18-pro-pro-max-10-new-features/">iPhone 18 Pro Launching on September 18 With These 10 New Features</a>&quot; first appeared on <a href="https://www.macrumors.com">MacRumors.com</a><br/><br/><a href="https://forums.macrumors.com/threads/iphone-18-pro-launching-on-september-18-with-these-10-new-features.2488956/">Discuss this article</a> in our forums<br/><br/>